[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835157957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105854#issuecomment-2835157957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105854","id":2835157957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o_RPF","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T12:57:11Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T15:49:19Z","body":"This is already tracked in:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101694\n\nBut leaving this open as it has more details\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835157957/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3466988676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105854#issuecomment-3466988676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105854","id":3466988676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OpgyE","user":{"login":"VojtaStruhar","id":49688205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Njg4MjA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49688205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar","html_url":"https://github.com/VojtaStruhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T09:43:39Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T09:43:39Z","body":"To me this looks like Godot is trying to be too smart and _infer_ the anchors preset from `anchor_*` properties.\n\n**Perhaps a simpler MRP:**\n\nI have an _inset rectangle_ for my popup class. It just has some 100px margins from each side of the screen, but anchor points are set exactly as they would be in the case of `Full Rect`.\n\n<img width=\"2080\" height=\"899\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ac72e01-8350-426b-9c89-bafed92071d3\" />\n\nThis is the node configuration saved in `main.tscn`\n\n```tscn\n[node name=\"100pxMargins\" type=\"Control\" parent=\".\"]\nlayout_mode = 1\nanchor_right = 1.0\nanchor_bottom = 1.0\noffset_left = 100.0\noffset_top = 100.0\noffset_right = -100.0\noffset_bottom = -100.0\ngrow_horizontal = 2\ngrow_vertical = 2\n```\n\nWhen I close and reopen the scene, the preset is replaced with `Full Rect`, even though before it was set to `Custom`. It also happens when I close and reopen the project.\n\n<img width=\"2072\" height=\"901\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e49e910-d9b2-4ffc-8e67-fbcbe46dc47b\" />\n\nYou can see in the scene file, that the `anchors_preset = 15` was added when it wasn't there previously.\n\n```tscn\n\n[node name=\"100pxMargins\" type=\"Control\" parent=\".\"]\nlayout_mode = 1\nanchors_preset = 15\nanchor_right = 1.0\nanchor_bottom = 1.0\noffset_left = 100.0\noffset_top = 100.0\noffset_right = -100.0\noffset_bottom = -100.0\ngrow_horizontal = 2\ngrow_vertical = 2\n```\n\nProject files:  [mrp-anchors.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23229981/mrp-anchors.zip)\n\n---\n\nSome more remarks:\n\n1. The `set_anchors_preset` accepts a [`LayoutPreset`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.5/classes/class_control.html#enum-control-layoutpreset) enum, but the enum doesn't have a `Custom` member! Could this be a problem? That Godot doesn't _explicitly_ mark the control as having custom anchors?\n2. The `\"anchors_preset\"` property is entirely internal, which makes searching for it a little hard\n3. There is this `stored_use_custom_anchors` property, so Godot _knows_ when I want a custom anchor setup, but doesn't save it anywhere?\n\nThe first thought that comes to my mind is that the `LayoutPreset` should get a `Custom` member to properly note that this is a custom setup.\n\n---\n\n**WORKAROUND**\n\nThe workaround I'll be using for the time being is to set the anchors to a _really small number_ from the anctual edge. This way Godot doesn't try to guess the anchor preset I'm trying to achieve and leaves my custom layout alone.\n\n<img width=\"719\" height=\"723\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b5352d1a-a4e5-4f14-bb4b-cc36b42b7aae\" />\n\n```tscn\n[node name=\"100pxMargins\" type=\"Control\" parent=\".\"]\nlayout_mode = 1\nanchor_left = 0.001\nanchor_top = 0.001\nanchor_right = 0.999\nanchor_bottom = 0.999\noffset_left = 100.0\noffset_top = 100.0\noffset_right = -100.0\noffset_bottom = -100.0\n```\n\nHope this helps.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3466988676/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3471509254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105854#issuecomment-3471509254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105854","id":3471509254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O6wcG","user":{"login":"VojtaStruhar","id":49688205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Njg4MjA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49688205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar","html_url":"https://github.com/VojtaStruhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T06:31:01Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T06:31:01Z","body":"Forgot to mention I'm using version **4.5.1**","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/